    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>幸せだな……
なべて世はこともなし。
何もないのが一番だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, this is true happiness... There's
pretty much nothing going on in
the world, and that's fantastic.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ……
おなかいっぱいだ。
幸せだなあ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aaah... I'm
stuffed. I'm
so happy...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このお店ね、頼めば宅配も
してくれるのよ。
嬉しくない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This restaurant will even
do delivery if you ask.
That's nice, isn't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なのに、なんで
店に来てるかって？
たまに来たくなるのよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"So why'd you come
in person?" I just to
stop by now and then~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ～お腹空いたわ～
今日は何食べようかしら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahhh, I'm so hungry~
What should I eat today...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっとー、この部屋、
暑すぎな～い？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, come o~on... Isn't it
a little too ho~ot in here?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285524</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>料理に火を使ってるから
暑いの我慢しろっての、
この店は？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Like, do they just expect us to
deal with it, 'cause they "cook
with an open flame" or whatever?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>料理はまだかぁ～！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is my order not
ready yet~!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あ、５秒前に
頼んだところだった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Oh, wait. It's only been five
seconds since I ordered...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>料理はまだか、まだか
ま・だ・か！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is my order ready yet!?
Is it ready!? Is. It. Ready!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あ、うるさいですね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Oh, that's kind of
annoying, I guess...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい！　私は
このレストランのマスター</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hello! Yes, I'm the proprietor
of this restaurant.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いつでもにこにこ、
笑顔だけが取り柄ですよ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm always, always
smiling! That's my
good point, you know. ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今日のオススメは
私のこの笑顔です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Today's special
is...my smile.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お値段もゼロガルド。
お買い得でしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The price? 0
Gald. Good deal,
don't you think?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おなかすいた～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm hungry~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あそこの三つ子、
また来てる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Those three girls
are here again...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このレストランは先日、
開店したばかりです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This restaurant
just opened a
few days ago.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オーナーはトーティスで
宿屋をやってた方だそうですよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It seems the owner
used to operate an
inn in Totus.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここのオーナーは、
例の惨劇後、こちらに
逃げてきたらしいですよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I heard the owner fled
here, to this town, after
that awful tragedy.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この店のおすすめは
やっぱハンバーグっすかね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The best thing on the
menu here's definitely
the hamburg steak.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>豊富なメニューも見どころっすよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But they've got
a wide selection!
It's great!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285564</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>メニューも定期的に
変わってるらしいっす</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It seems they change up
their menu now and then, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285564</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だから毎回来るのが
楽しみなんすよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I look forward
to it every time
I come here!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今日もひばりが鳴いている……
あーいや……空耳かな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I hear another skylark today...
...Wait... Maybe I imagined it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひばりが来ると
春なんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once the skylarks show
up, you'll know it's spring.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いつになったら、私にも
春が来るのかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And I'll reach my
own springtime,
too, someday...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わたしはトーティスで生まれて
トーティスで育ったのさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I was born and
raised in Totus.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>父の宿屋を継いだんだけど
結局、いろいろあってね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I inherited my father's
inn, but...well, so much
has happened...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大切にしてた
ブッシュベイビーの置物……
どこへ行ったんだろうね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder where that bush
baby statue ended up...
It was really special to me...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Cless&gt;ちゃんには
昔よく手伝ってもらったよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Cless&gt; helped me out
a lot in the past.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今じゃ、英雄って
呼ばれてるようだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And now people
call him a hero.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いつも美味しくて、
安心できるお食事をこの店は
提供してくれるんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This restaurant's food is
always delicious, so I can
order without all the stress.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>12</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お料理来るのも
けっこう早いしね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And they bring the food
out pretty quick, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>12</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ね？　知ってる？　このお店、
幻のアルヴァニスタ料理を
出してくれるのよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, have you heard? This
restaurant actually sells a very
rare Alvanistan delicacy...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>13</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このお店で話題の
アルヴァニスタ料理、
期間限定らしいわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That Alvanistan dish is
popular, but I also heard
it's a limited-time special!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
