    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270684</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よろしく頼むわ！
右奥の三つ子、よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, I'll leave it to
you! It's the three girls
in the back, on the right.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>64</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271276</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>特上焼肉セット
本まぐろ丼
お水と塩
もうちょっと待って！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Gourmet Yakiniku Set
Fresh Tuna Donburi
Water &amp; Salt
Gimmie a bit longer!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>22</SpeakerId>
      <Id>65</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あら、いらっしゃい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh my. Welcome in.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>66</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>特上焼肉セット３つお願いします。
わたしの注文が本当です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We'll take three
Gourmet Yakiniku Sets.
My order is the real one.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>23</SpeakerId>
      <Id>67</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273880</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ハンバーグ……
カレー……
パスタ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hamburg steak...
Curry... Pasta...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>23</SpeakerId>
      <Id>68</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>べっ、別にあなたたちのために
イジワルしたんじゃないんだからねっ！
……です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-It's not like I'm being
mean just for your sake,
or anything! ...Ahem.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>23</SpeakerId>
      <Id>69</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>べっ、べつにお店に嫌がらせに
来てるんじゃないんだからねっ！
……です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-I didn't come here just to
pester the restaurant staff,
or anything! ...Ahem.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>23</SpeakerId>
      <Id>70</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274972</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>少女ちゃんのはウソですよ。
今日はお肉よりもお魚！
本まぐろ丼をお願いします</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Girl A's order is fake. Today,
we'd rather fish than meat!
Fresh Tuna Donburi, please.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>24</SpeakerId>
      <Id>71</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わたしたちはどこから来て
どこへ行くというのでしょう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Where did we come from?
Where will we go from here...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>24</SpeakerId>
      <Id>72</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うちの家系は代々
このお店の常連なんです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Our family have frequented
this restaurant for generations.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>24</SpeakerId>
      <Id>73</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あのウェイトレスさんの家系も
代々このお店に勤めているそうです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And I believe that waitress's family
have worked here for generations, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>24</SpeakerId>
      <Id>74</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275804</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こうなるともはや宿命……
そう、宿命のライバルです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, this must be fate...
Yes, she is our fated rival.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>24</SpeakerId>
      <Id>75</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ……レストランに来ると
おかみを呼べ！
……って叫びたくなってしまいます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh... Every time we come here,
I just want to shout, "Summon
the proprietress! At once!"</EnglishText>
      <Notes>reference?</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>24</SpeakerId>
      <Id>76</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276236</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>口あたりはまったり
それでいてしつこくないこの味、
さすがです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A perfect, full-bodied mouthfeel, and this
flavor, never overstated... But of course,
this restaurant's cooking is always so.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>24</SpeakerId>
      <Id>77</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>最近太っちゃったので、
全員お水と塩で。
女の子ちゃんの注文はダミーです！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We've gained weight recently,
so we'll just have water and
salt. Girl B's order is a trick!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
